# Realistic Uncertainty Scenario: Ad Hoc Rules in TransactionEnv.track_order

## Uncertainty Manifestation: Carrier-Specific Tracking Number Format Requirements

**Description**:
The `track_order` function requires tracking numbers to follow specific carrier-prefixed formats that aren't intuitive to developers. All tracking numbers must be prefixed with a carrier code followed by a colon (e.g., "UPS:", "FEDEX:", "USPS:") even though this isn't a standard industry practice for tracking numbers. The function silently fails to provide accurate tracking information if this format isn't followed, returning generic status information instead of detailed tracking data.

